cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the manuscript when using these results."
type: software
title: "An unbounded obstruction to projection AM–GM in Loewner order"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/dvgyl/math-and-theory"
abstract: >-
  Three real orthogonal projections in dimension three rule out every finite
  multiplicative bound of their symmetrized product by the cube of their
  arithmetic mean in Loewner order. The mean can be positive definite and
  the projections rational. The software verifies the actual matrix
  obstruction in Lean; the manuscript proves the additional properties.
